NAME
    readers - find static read references to an address

SYNOPSIS
    readers <addr> [<scanstart> <scanlen>]

DESCRIPTION
    The read-side complement to 'writers': finds every instruction
    statically reading <addr>, e.g. every branch of game logic that checks
    a flag's value - not just the one spot noticed while manually tracing
    execution. Same addressing-mode limitation as 'writers'.

EXAMPLES
    readers 13c6
